---
import Landing from '../../layouts/Landing.astro'
---

<Landing
  lang="en"
  title="Idle manager — local multi-account shell"
  description="Idle manager is a local multi-account shell. It does not automate play, inject cheats, spoof fingerprints, use proxies, or share one cookie jar."
>
  <section id="isolation" class="claim">
    <h1>Idle manager is a local multi-account shell.</h1>
    <p>
      It does not automate play, inject cheats, spoof fingerprints, use proxies, or share one cookie
      jar.
    </p>
    <ul class="rack" aria-label="Isolated accounts stay in separate jars">
      <li>
        <span class="jar">Account A</span>
        <strong>Own cookie jar</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="jar">Account B</span>
        <strong>Own cookie jar</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="jar">Account C</span>
        <strong>Own cookie jar</strong>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="not-a-bot" class="not-bot">
    <h2>What it is not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Not a bot or macro tool</li>
      <li>Not a cheat injector</li>
      <li>Not a fingerprint spoof</li>
      <li>Not a proxy or anti-detect browser</li>
      <li>Not a shared cookie-jar swapper</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Landing>
